WEBVTT

00:11:27.156 --> 00:11:30.676
[is] financed by a system of toll roads.

00:11:30.716 --> 00:11:33.116
We have a toll ring in Oslo,

00:11:33.156 --> 00:11:35.236
and to go into that zone,

00:11:35.236 --> 00:11:39.396
a non-electrical vehicle
has to pay a high price.

00:11:40.156 --> 00:11:44.196
And that price will increase 40 percent

00:11:44.236 --> 00:11:47.356
January 1, 2024.

00:11:47.876 --> 00:11:50.636
This have not been [an] easy negotiation,

00:11:50.676 --> 00:11:53.716
and taxes are always controversial.

00:11:53.756 --> 00:12:00.196
But this is [an] important incentive
to transition away from fossil fuels.